41641::$$$message_0320_0000_0000$$$::"Promo art #3."::
41642::$$$message_0320_0001_0000$$$::"Hmmm, Caren looks even weirder from the side."::
41643::$$$message_0320_0002_0000$$$::"...Don't tell me you see her as competition?"::
41644::$$$message_0320_0003_0000$$$::"No way. [wvl canskip=0 time=400]Deliberately not covering up isn't the same as failing to cover up..."::
41645::$$$message_0320_0004_0000$$$::"Did I just say something deep? [wvl canskip=0 time=400]Was that insightful?"::
41646::$$$message_0320_0005_0000$$$::"You remind me that youth can sometimes bring even greater harm than negligence."::

